    "Metadata": {
        "Id": "a3770c1a-6a6f-468e-adc4-bb52c3898ceb",
        "Type": "usercreated",
        "Title": "Maybe it&apos;s the shrimp?",
        "Location": "LOCATION_WET_RAT",
        "PublicId": "130507815346",
        "ScenePath": "assembly:/_pro/scenes/missions/wet/scene_rat_basic.entity",
        "TileImage": "$($repository 0cb9d334-99b3-4cab-9dba-6d7c3691a328).Image",
        "Description": "From: xxxxxx@xxxxxx.edu\r\rI could use your help. \r\rOur facility has come under scrutiny and a  board member has just flown in to conduct an audit.\r\rI can&apos;t have that. Not right now, anyway. The best moment to get to him is while he&apos;ll be grabbing a bite at a local eatery.\r\rIf foul play is suspected, the jig will be up, so be discreet. Food poisoning sounds like the best cover. I&apos;ve also identified two nosy locals who happen to be regulars. With all three dead, they&apos;ll blame a bad batch of shrimp.",
        "GameVersion": "8.7.0.0",
